the three posts that had more comments than points, two are about advertising. Some of the links from the HN posts were broken, so I've changed the links here. Too lazy to set up redirects in some cases, unfortunately. I've also removed links for most of the Show HNs since the projects they discussed are defunct. I merged The Sample into Yakread, so it kind of lives on."}, :excerpts [{:text "... points, 457 comments Biff.graph: structure your Clojure codebase as a queryable graph 147 points, 32...", :matched-terms ["clojure"], :source :content} {:text "... 33 comments Biff.core: system composition for Clojure web apps 138 points, 33 comments Biff – a batteries-included web framework for Clojure 137 points, 23 comments Should you Work Hard?...", :matched-terms ["clojure"], :source :content} {:text "... HN: Biff – Self-hosted Firebase alternative for Clojure 103 points, 19 comments Building a CRUD App with Datomic Cloud Ions 100 points, 26 comments Structuring large Clojure codebases with Biff 98 points, 8 comments Show...", :matched-terms ["clojure" "datomic"], :source :content}]}]